{
  "title": "Warm Spicy Jamaican Chinese Broccoli Skillet",
  "description": "A peppery and chewy low-carb friendly Jamaican dish featuring Chinese broccoli, perfect for a brunch mood. This cure infused skillet is a unique blend of Jamaican and Chinese flavors.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican Chinese",
  "diet": [
